From b4a97bc94b2e4e4f38a7bf8511453edd81ef55c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 18:25:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] style: finish orange -> black/white/gray theme conversion

Replaces remaining orange Tailwind utility classes (orange-NNN -> gray-NNN)
and hardcoded orange hex/rgba accent colors across all Landing + Dashboard
app pages and dialogs with theme-aware --brand/--brand-light/--brand-rgb
CSS vars (black accent in light mode, white accent in dark mode).

Also recolors the CinematicBackground/StarField canvas particle systems and
the unused ThreeScene component from orange/purple/blue palette to a
monochrome white/gray starfield, matching the space background effect.
